y"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 42 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 198% of normal in August to September and 49% in November to December. In 2026 so far, the middle sat at 26% of normal in February to March and 31% in January to February. Every grid had its driest year in 2012, down to 44% on grid 25311.</p>"}
